# Downloaded faceplate reference photos (source material for hand-authoring the
# panel SVGs). The SVGs we build FROM them are committed; the photos are not.
*-faceplate-reference.*

# Rendered demo narration. Regenerated by `npm run speech`, and NOT byte-stable — the same words
# rendered twice give different files — so committing it while the copy is still churning would put a
# fresh ~30 kB blob in history for every reworded line, and the whole set again for every voice
# experiment. Kept local while authoring; committed deliberately once the wording settles, since the
# web build needs it to have any narration at all.
demos/speech/
